<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 8: </span>Improvement for BERT-base model on GLUE-large tasks distilled by <span id="S5.T8.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">ARMADA</span> with Stable Diffusion teacher model, compared against the improvements reported by multimodal KD methods.</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="S5.SS1.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S5.SS1.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.SS1.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Results on multimodal task.</span> We highlight the performance obtained by BERT-12L on the MM-IMDb classification task in Table <a href="#S5.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ 5.1 Results on NLU and Reasoning Tasks ‣ 5 Experimental Results ‣ From Images to Words: Efficient Cross-Modal Knowledge Distillation to Language Models from Black-box Teachers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>. With cross-modal distillation, the BERT-12L model achieves a +1.2% improvement in macro-F1 and +1.3% improvement in micro-F1 over the undistilled baseline. Notably, this gain is comparable to the improvement reported by <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib62" title="" class="ltx_ref">Kiela et al. (2019)</a></cite> using a fully multimodal BERT architecture. Importantly, in our setting the teacher and student share no common modality at inference time, demonstrating that <span id="S5.SS1.p5.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">ARMADA</span> effectively transfers multimodal priors into a unimodal language model without architectural modification.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S5.T9" class="ltx_table ltx_align_floatleft" style="width:51%;">
<div id="S5.T9.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:238.1pt;height:59.2pt;vertical-align:-27.6pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-29.8pt,7.4pt) scale(0.8,0.8) ;">
<table id="S5.T9.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S5.T9.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S5.T9.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt"><span id="S5.T9.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Models</span></th>
<th id="S5.T9.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt"><span id="S5.T9.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Distillation type</span></th>
<th id="S5.T9.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="S5.T9.2.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">MM-IMDb</span></th>
<th id="S5.T9.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="S5.T9.2.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Meme</span></th></tr>
<tr id="S5.T9.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S5.T9.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_th ltx_th_row"></th>
