</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S6.T15.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S6.T15.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" rowspan="2"><span id="S6.T15.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">1</span></td>
<td id="S6.T15.2.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_tt">
<span id="S6.T15.2.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:240.0pt;">
<span id="S6.T15.2.1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.T15.2.1.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">As you eat the most, you want the least.</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S6.T15.2.1.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="S6.T15.2.1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">0</span></td>
<td id="S6.T15.2.1.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="S6.T15.2.1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">0</span></td>
<td id="S6.T15.2.1.2.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="S6.T15.2.1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">0.097</span></td>
<td id="S6.T15.2.1.2.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="S6.T15.2.1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">0.001 (99%)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S6.T15.2.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S6.T15.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="S6.T15.2.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:240.0pt;">
<span id="S6.T15.2.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.T15.2.1.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Who is she trying to make up to now?</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S6.T15.2.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="S6.T15.2.1.3.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">1</span></td>
